*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% PPD for the HP LaserJet P1005 with the p1005-native driver (rastertoxqx).
*% Page sizes, margins and media codes mirror HP's own P1005 PPD (1.6.1) so
*% the raster matches what HP's driver received.  Options reach the filter
*% through the raster header (cupsInteger1-3, cupsMediaType).
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "P1005NAT.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "HP"
*Product: "(HP LaserJet P1005)"
*ModelName: "HP LaserJet P1005"
*ShortNickName: "HP LaserJet P1005 native"
